x) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 33.33vw, 33.33vw\" style=\"display:block;object-position: var(--image-component-focal-point);object-fit: var(--image-component-object-fit);\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1724226686959-UJ5U75P59FVUICTU4T5C/new+zealand+photographer.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\" data-image-component=\"1.0.1\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption\n          data-sqsp-image-classic-block-caption-container\n          \n          class=\"image-caption-wrapper\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"image-caption\"></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-6 span-6\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-d6c07dbb3ffccffa41c3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">James Hirata:<br>Shareholder, Nomado Ltd (New Zealand)<br>Director &amp; Shareholder, Kiwi Photography \u5408\u540C\u4F1A\u793E (GK, Japan)<br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">2011-2014: Wellington, New Zealand (University, Bachelor of Architectural Studies)<br>2014-2017: Auckland, New Zealand - Commercial Photo/Video<br>2014-2019: Auckland, New Zealand - Lifestyle Media<br>2018: Company formation <a href=\"http://nomad.wedding/\" target=\"_blank\">(Nomado Ltd)</a> in New Zealand<br>2019-2024: Queenstown, New Zealand - <a href=\"https://propertymedia.co.nz/\" target=\"_blank\">Commercial</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://nomad.wedding/\" target=\"_blank\">Lifestyle Media</a> (ongoing) <br>2024: Niseko, Hokkaido Japan - Commercial, <a href=\"https://nisekomemories.jp/\" target=\"_blank\">Lifestyle</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://nomadweddings.jp/\" target=\"_blank\">Wedding</a> Media<br><br>I come from a background in Architecture brings 10 years of experience in Real Estate Media and Lifestyle Media (Wedding Media) in New Zealand, topped with another 3 years of experience as an Architectural Visualisation 3D Artist. <br><br>To be closer to relatives, I have moved back to Japan after spending 22 years in New Zealand.<br>My company in New Zealand now operates without my input, giving me the opportunity to pursue new businesses in Japan. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/96380b1a-b9be-46e5-ae89-cf5eed2be5f1_1161/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/96380b1a-b9be-46e5-ae89-cf5eed2be5f1_1161/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1727877863147_10102\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1727877863147_10102\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container  sqs-block-button-container--center \"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"https://nomad.wedding/shigenobu\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    target=\"_blank\"\n  >\n    Learn About Our Businesses\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<style>\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1727877863147_10102 {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 0;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-1 span-1\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/afff8308-43ce-4541-b238-a6dd9502fe90_1314/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/afff8308-43ce-4541-b238-a6dd9502fe90_1314/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"c3cf16604ff58838f4ea\" id=\"block-c3cf16604ff58838f4ea\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div>",
